 of the Doppelganger's Physical Attack each time a Doppelganger deals damage.\nSun or his Doppelgangers' Basic Attacks deal 65 extra damage to creeps.","icon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_6d93eddf722334375d384ee8965f95f7.png","video":null,"cd":null,"cost":null,"is_passive":true,"tags":[{"name":"Debuff","rgb":"205,93,109"},{"name":"Heal","rgb":"89,168,111"}]},{"id":2710,"name":"Endless Variety","description":"Sun hurls his Golden Staff in the target direction, dealing 280 (+40% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies in its path. Upon hitting an enemy hero or creep or reaching maximum range, the Golden Staff morphs into a Doppelganger that pursues enemies. The Doppelganger inherits Sun's attributes, deals 60% damage, and takes 150% damage for 5s.\n\nThis skill shares its level and cooldown with Swift Exchange.","icon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_0d813a2495b9950a4a57fb9e750212ba.png","video":null,"cd":6.5,"cost":70.0,"is_passive":false,"tags":[{"name":"Summon","rgb":"97,127,198"},{"name":"AOE","rgb":"199,121,85"}]},{"id":2750,"name":"Swift Exchange","description":"Sun hurls his Golden Staff in the target direction, dealing 280 (+40% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies in its path.\n\nHe conjures a Doppelganger at his location that inherits his attributes, deals 60% damage, and takes 150% damage for 5s.\nSun transforms into the Golden Staff and becomes concealed, reappearing at its maximum range.","icon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_7afa1977abd09809a0cfacccfd2f5cfd.png","video":null,"cd":6.5,"cost":70.0,"is_passive":false,"tags":[{"name":"Mobility","rgb":"162,105,198"},{"name":"Summon","rgb":"97,127,198"}]},{"id":2720,"name":"Instantaneous Move","description":"Sun commands his Doppelgangers to strike at the target enemy with him, dealing 270 (+40% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage and slowing the target and enemies behind them by 25% (can be stacked) for 1.5s. This counts as Basic Attack damage and can trigger Attack Effects but cannot Crit.","icon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_871502bcbd804479198c0374db30dd5a.png","video":null,"cd":5.0,"cost":40.0,"is_passive":false,"tags":[{"name":"Burst","rgb":"199,121,85"},{"name":"Mobility","rgb":"162,105,198"}]},{"id":2730,"name":"Clone Techniques","description":"Sun summons a Doppelganger that inherits his attributes, deals 80% damage, and takes 120% damage for 8s.","icon":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_18d2d2e16311dff12a1a8518fc823e4d.png","video":null,"cd":32.0,"cost":null,"is_passive":false,"tags":[{"name":"Summon","rgb":"97,127,198"}]}],"counters":{"assist":{"desc":"Pair Sun with tanks who have strong CC abilities such as Belerick or Tigreal to create opportunities for Sun to deal damage.","heroes":[{"id":70,"name":"Belerick","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_5f2a9eca0bafd4ed8dc39a93c771b3af.png"},{"id":6,"name":"Tigreal","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_8b30576754be1a4f8bebd09df8d6bec7.png"}]},"strong":{"desc":"Sun can deal great sustained damage and has armor-busting capabilities, making him a good counter to tanks with low damage output, such as Franco and Gatotkaca.","heroes":[{"id":10,"name":"Franco","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_9bed3c0095335606e0ce616c6e5a8553.png"},{"id":41,"name":"Gatotkaca","head":"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_96f9dbbc096e0f0a28f9b9e587d06a9c.png"}]},"weak":{"desc":"Fighter heroes with Lifesteal can counter Sun, however. For example, heroes like Ruby can steal a lot of HP by hitting Sun and his Dopplegangers.","heroes":[{"id":29,"name":"Ruby","head":"https://akmweb.youngj